@startuml analytics-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (analytics-service) - FR-14\nOwner: Mostafa Khamis Abozead
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IAnalytics <<provided>> {
  +getGoalWorkload(goalId): Workload
  +isOverloaded(goalId): boolean
  +getStudentWorkloads(studentId): List<Workload>
}

class AnalyticsService <<component>> {
  -studentProfile: IStudentProfile
  -scheduling: IScheduling
  -repository: IWorkloadRepository
  -workloadCalculator: WorkloadCalculator
  -availabilityCalculator: AvailabilityCalculator
  --
  +getGoalWorkload(...) / isOverloaded(...)
  +getStudentWorkloads(...)
}

IAnalytics <|.. AnalyticsService
class WorkloadCalculator <<component>> {
  +remaining(tasks): int
  +percentCompleted(tasks): int
}
AnalyticsService --> WorkloadCalculator
class AvailabilityCalculator <<component>> {
  +remainingTime(slots, targetDate): int
}
AnalyticsService --> AvailabilityCalculator

interface IStudentProfile <<required - Student service>> {
  +createProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +updateProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +getProfile(studentId): Profile
  +getAvailability(studentId): List<TimeSlot>
}

AnalyticsService --> IStudentProfile
interface IScheduling <<required - Scheduling service>> {
  +scheduleTasks(studentId): Schedule
  +getConflicts(studentId): List<Conflict>
  +suggestSlots(taskId): List<TimeSlot>
  +moveTask(taskId, slot): void
  +markDone(taskId, done): void
  +getScheduledTasks(studentId, range): List<ScheduledTask>
}

AnalyticsService --> IScheduling
interface IWorkloadRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Workload): void
  +findById(id): Workload
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Workload>
}

AnalyticsService --> IWorkloadRepository
class Workload {
  -goalId: String
  -remainingWorkload: int
  -remainingStudyTime: int
  -percentCompleted: int
  --
  +isOverloaded(): boolean
}
IWorkloadRepository --> Workload
note bottom of AnalyticsService
SOLID applied:
S - AnalyticsService only coordinates; WorkloadCalculator, AvailabilityCalculator each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing AnalyticsService.
L - AnalyticsService can replace any other IAnalytics implementation.
I - IAnalytics has only the operations its clients use.
D - AnalyticsService depends on interfaces (IStudentProfile, IScheduling, IWorkloadRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
